<template>
  <div class="site landing-page landing-v2 landing-brand">
    <SiteHeader />
    <main>
      <section class="v2-hero" aria-labelledby="landing-title" data-dogfood="landing-brand">
        <p class="v2-kicker"><span></span> Full-stack application compiler</p>
        <h1 id="landing-title">编译整套应用，<br /><em>不只是一棵组件树。</em></h1>
        <p class="v2-lede">VMZ 从组件、状态和服务端边界中建立程序图。开发时只重编译受影响的区域，交付时为 Web、SSR、Native 和 Edge 生成各自需要的结果。</p>
        <div class="v2-actions">
          <a class="v2-button v2-button--primary" href="/d/zh-hans/guide/">开始构建</a>
          <a class="v2-button v2-button--text" href="/d/">阅读文档 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="v2-signal" aria-label="VMZ compilation model">
          <div><small>Author</small><strong>Components</strong></div>
          <i aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <div class="is-core"><small>Understand</small><strong>Program Graph</strong></div>
          <i aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <div><small>Deliver</small><strong>Every surface</strong></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="v2-statement" aria-labelledby="statement-title">
        <p class="v2-index">01 / WHY VMZ</p>
        <div>
          <h2 id="statement-title">让浏览器少做一些，<br />让编译器多理解一些。</h2>
          <p>多数框架把大量工作留到运行时。VMZ 把依赖关系、更新路径和交付边界提前变成可分析的程序结构。</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="v2-features" aria-label="VMZ core capabilities">
        <article class="v2-feature v2-feature--dark">
          <span class="v2-feature__number">01</span>
          <div class="v2-feature__icon">↯</div>
          <h3>修改之后，快速回来</h3>
          <p>文件变化沿依赖图传播。重分析、重编译和页面更新只覆盖真正受影响的区域。</p>
          <small>Incremental analysis</small>
        </article>
        <article class="v2-feature v2-feature--lime">
          <span class="v2-feature__number">02</span>
          <div class="v2-feature__icon">◎</div>
          <h3>浏览器只接手必要工作</h3>
          <p>能在生成阶段确定的依赖、调度和事件边界，不再交给通用客户端运行时重复判断。</p>
          <small>Direct update</small>
        </article>
        <article class="v2-feature v2-feature--paper">
          <span class="v2-feature__number">03</span>
          <div class="v2-feature__icon">⌁</div>
          <h3>服务端与客户端共享模型</h3>
          <p>HTML 可以先到达，交互可以稍后恢复；无需为两端维护互相漂移的应用逻辑。</p>
          <small>SSR resume</small>
        </article>
        <article class="v2-feature v2-feature--coral">
          <span class="v2-feature__number">04</span>
          <div class="v2-feature__icon">◇</div>
          <h3>一份程序，多种交付结果</h3>
          <p>同一份应用语义可以面向 Browser、SSR、Native 与 Edge 生成不同 Host Profile。</p>
          <small>Multi-platform</small>
        </article>
      </section>

      <section class="v2-feedback" aria-labelledby="feedback-title">
        <div class="v2-feedback__copy">
          <p class="v2-index">02 / DEVELOPMENT</p>
          <h2 id="feedback-title">保持思路，<br />不用等待整套应用。</h2>
          <p>保存组件后，VMZ 先定位受影响的依赖，再生成局部结果。反馈路径围绕程序图工作，而不是重新遍历所有内容。</p>
        </div>
        <ol class="v2-activity">
          <li><span>Changed</span><strong>Counter.vmz</strong><small>Source saved</small></li>
          <li><span>Analyzed</span><strong>1 affected region</strong><small>Dependency graph updated</small></li>
          <li class="is-current"><span>Delivered</span><strong>Browser is ready</strong><small>Only affected nodes updated</small></li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <section class="v2-flow" aria-labelledby="flow-title">
        <div class="v2-section-head"><p class="v2-index">03 / COMPILER PIPELINE</p><h2 id="flow-title">从编写到交付，一条连续路径。</h2></div>
        <ol>
          <li><b>Write</b><span>单文件组件</span></li>
          <li><b>Analyze</b><span>依赖与边界</span></li>
          <li><b>Compile</b><span>精确更新计划</span></li>
          <li><b>Render</b><span>HTML 与静态输出</span></li>
          <li><b>Resume</b><span>按需恢复交互</span></li>
          <li><b>Deploy</b><span>多环境交付</span></li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <section id="showcase" class="v2-showcase" aria-labelledby="showcase-title">
        <div class="v2-section-head">
          <p class="v2-index">04 / @VMZ/UI</p>
          <h2 id="showcase-title">构建产品界面，也用我们自己的组件。</h2>
          <p>下面的状态、切换、表格和通知全部由 <code>@vmz/ui</code> 组成。它面向需要长期维护的商业应用，而不只是组件演示。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="v2-product">
          <aside class="v2-product__side">
            <div class="v2-product__identity"><span class="v2-product__logo">V</span><strong>VMZ Cloud</strong></div>
            <nav aria-label="Product navigation"><a class="is-active" href="#showcase">概览</a><a href="#showcase">项目</a><a href="/deploy-planner">部署</a><a href="#showcase">监控</a></nav>
            <small>Production workspace</small>
          </aside>
          <div class="v2-product__work">
          <div class="v2-product__bar"><div><span>Projects / vmz-site</span><strong>Release Center</strong></div><Button type="button" onClick={() => (notifyOpen = true)}>创建发布</Button></div>
          <Tabs label="Product views" selected={showcaseTab} panelId="landing-showcase-panel" items={showcaseTabs} onSelect={(id) => (showcaseTab = id)}>
            <div if={showcaseTab === 'overview'} class="v2-dashboard">
              <div class="v2-metrics"><Card title="Build" description="main · latest"><Badge tone="success">Ready</Badge><strong>Production</strong></Card><Card title="Affected scope" description="Last compilation"><Badge tone="info">Direct</Badge><strong>1 region</strong></Card><Card title="Targets" description="Current profile"><Badge tone="brand">4 active</Badge><strong>Web to Edge</strong></Card></div>
              <div class="v2-table"><Table columns={surfaceColumns} rows={surfaceRows} sortKey="surface" sortDir="asc" hasRowAction={false} /></div>
            </div>
            <div if={showcaseTab === 'source'} class="v2-source"><CodeBlock code={codeSample} language="vmz" title="Counter.vmz" /></div>
            <div if={showcaseTab === 'activity'} class="v2-empty"><Badge tone="success">All systems ready</Badge><h3>最近的变更已经交付。</h3><p>Program Graph 与所有目标环境保持同步。</p></div>
          </Tabs></div>
        </div>
        <div if={notifyOpen} class="v2-notification"><Notification tone="success" roleName="status" title="发布已创建" description="Web、SSR、Native 与 Edge 目标正在生成。"><Button type="button" variant="ghost" onClick={() => (notifyOpen = false)}>关闭</Button></Notification></div>
      </section>

      <section class="v2-start" aria-labelledby="start-title">
        <p class="v2-index">05 / GET STARTED</p>
        <h2 id="start-title">从一个组件开始。</h2>
        <p>创建项目，启动开发服务器，让 VMZ 接管后面的分析与编译。</p>
        <div class="v2-command"><code>pnpm create vmz-app my-app</code><Button type="button" variant="secondary" onClick={() => this.copyCommand()}>{copied ? '已复制' : '复制'}</Button></div>
        <div class="v2-actions"><a class="v2-button v2-button--light" href="/d/zh-hans/guide/">开始使用</a><a class="v2-button v2-button--dark-text" href="/deploy-planner">部署计划器 →</a></div>
      </section>
    </main>
    <SiteFooter />
  </div>
</template>

<script client>
export default class IndexPage {
  showcaseTab = 'overview';
  notifyOpen = false;
  copied = false;
  showcaseTabs = [{ id: 'overview', title: '概览', controls: 'landing-showcase-panel' }, { id: 'source', title: '源码', controls: 'landing-showcase-panel' }, { id: 'activity', title: '活动', controls: 'landing-showcase-panel' }];
  codeSample = '<template>\n  <Button onClick={increment}>\n    Count {count}\n  </Button>\n</template>';
  surfaceColumns = [{ id: 'surface', title: '目标' }, { id: 'result', title: '交付结果' }, { id: 'status', title: '状态' }];
  surfaceRows = [{ id: 'browser', cells: ['Browser', 'Direct DOM update', 'Ready'] }, { id: 'ssr', cells: ['SSR', 'HTML + resume', 'Ready'] }, { id: 'native', cells: ['Native', 'Host operations', 'Ready'] }, { id: 'edge', cells: ['Edge', 'Server capabilities', 'Ready'] }];

  copyCommand() {
    const text = 'pnpm create vmz-app my-app';
    const ok = () => {
      this.copied = true;
    };
    const fail = () => {
      this.copied = false;
    };
    if (typeof navigator !== 'undefined' && navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText) {
      navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(ok, fail);
      return;
    }
    fail();
  }
}
</script>
